    <item>
      <title>Projects</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/projects/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/projects/</guid>
      <description>
&lt;div id=&#34;outline-container-headline-1&#34; class=&#34;outline-3&#34;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;headline-1&#34;&gt;
&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/EmbeddingBits/simple-processor-simulation&#34;&gt;4-bit Processor Simulation&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div id=&#34;outline-text-headline-1&#34; class=&#34;outline-text-3&#34;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
An &lt;strong&gt;educational 4-bit processor design&lt;/strong&gt; implemented in &lt;strong&gt;Verilog&lt;/strong&gt; for learning &lt;strong&gt;computer architecture fundamentals&lt;/strong&gt;.  
Includes instruction set design, ALU operations, and memory management simulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Stack:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code class=&#34;verbatim&#34;&gt;Verilog&lt;/code&gt; • &lt;code class=&#34;verbatim&#34;&gt;VLSI&lt;/code&gt; • &lt;code class=&#34;verbatim&#34;&gt;Computer Architecture&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/EmbeddingBits/simple-processor-simulation&#34;&gt;Source on GitHub&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&#34;outline-container-headline-2&#34; class=&#34;outline-3&#34;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;headline-2&#34;&gt;
&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/EmbeddingBits/fastsh&#34;&gt;Fastsh&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div id=&#34;outline-text-headline-2&#34; class=&#34;outline-text-3&#34;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
A POSIX-compliant shell that I&amp;#39;m building for personal use cases (&lt;strong&gt;under development&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Stack:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code class=&#34;verbatim&#34;&gt;Zig&lt;/code&gt; • &lt;code class=&#34;verbatim&#34;&gt;Systems Programming&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/EmbeddingBits/fastsh&#34;&gt;Source on GitHub&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&#34;outline-container-headline-3&#34; class=&#34;outline-2&#34;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;headline-3&#34;&gt;
Get In Touch
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div id=&#34;outline-text-headline-3&#34; class=&#34;outline-text-2&#34;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
Interested in collaborating on a project or discussing technology?  
Feel free to reach out!&lt;/p&gt;
